#: ../../tools/medgen_tools.rst:32 19dae0e1301143e0b7aed7098df99725
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get HPO clinical features (phenotypes) associated with a"
" genetic condition from NCBI MedGen. Returns feature names, HPO IDs, UMLS"
" CUIs, and definitions. Useful for phenotype-driven diagnosis. Example: "
"uid='41393' (cystic fibrosis) returns bronchiectasis, meconium ileus, "
"male infertility, etc."
msgstr ""

