#: ../../tools/medgen_tools.rst:66 7e27484801904d55af9bddd7b8339f2e
msgid "**Name**: ``MedGen_get_condition``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/medgen_tools.rst:68 4265e77f2e964b3982dda0d1d1802610
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed information about a specific genetic "
"condition from NCBI MedGen by UID or UMLS CUI. Returns full definition, "
"associated genes, OMIM IDs, synonyms, modes of inheritance, and clinical "
"features (HPO phenotypes). Example: uid='41393' returns cystic fibrosis "
"with CFTR/TGFB1/FCGR2A genes, autosomal recessive inheritance, 30+ "
"clinical features."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/medgen_tools.rst:72 bd3f37a062ad452186b618e18788e097
msgid ""
"``uid`` (string) (optional) MedGen UID (e.g., '41393' for cystic "
"fibrosis). Get from MedGen\\_search\\_conditions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/medgen_tools.rst:75 a7e8d0cd65164ce0bfe056d183ef6e47
msgid ""
"``cui`` (string) (optional) UMLS Concept Unique Identifier (e.g., "
"'C0010674' for cystic fibrosis). Alternative to uid."
msgstr ""

